  68:BSP/OLED/OLED.c **** /**
  69:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 数据存储格式：
  70:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 纵向8点，高位在下，先从左到右，再从上到下
  71:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 每一个Bit对应一个像素点
  72:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *
  73:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B0 B0                  B0 B0
  74:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B1 B1                  B1 B1
  75:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B2 B2                  B2 B2
  76:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B3 B3  ------------->  B3 B3 --
  77:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B4 B4                  B4 B4  |
  78:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B5 B5                  B5 B5  |
  79:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B6 B6                  B6 B6  |
  80:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B7 B7                  B7 B7  |
  81:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *                                    |
  82:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  -----------------------------------
  83:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  |
  84:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  |   B0 B0                  B0 B0
  85:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  |   B1 B1                  B1 B1
  86:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  |   B2 B2                  B2 B2
  87:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  --> B3 B3  ------------->  B3 B3
  88:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B4 B4                  B4 B4
  89:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B5 B5                  B5 B5
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccFRbyPM.s 			page 3


  90:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B6 B6                  B6 B6
  91:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      B7 B7                  B7 B7
  92:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *
  93:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 坐标轴定义：
  94:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 左上角为(0, 0)点
  95:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 横向向右为X轴，取值范围：0~127
  96:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  * 纵向向下为Y轴，取值范围：0~63
  97:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *
  98:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *       0             X轴           127
  99:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      .------------------------------->
 100:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *    0 |
 101:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      |
 102:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      |
 103:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      |
 104:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *  Y轴 |
 105:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      |
 106:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      |
 107:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      |
 108:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *   63 |
 109:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *      v
 110:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  *
 111:BSP/OLED/OLED.c ****  */
